---METADATA---
TARGET: packages/nextjs/components/LoadingRoast.tsx
DESCRIPTION: Fun loading animation while roast is being generated
DEPENDENCIES: none
PRIORITY: low
---END_METADATA---

Create a React component that displays a fun loading animation while the roast is being generated.

Requirements:
- No external dependencies needed
- Use Tailwind CSS and daisyUI for styling

Component should display:
1. Animated spinner or custom loading animation
2. Rotating funny messages that change every 2 seconds:
   - "Analyzing your poor life choices..."
   - "Counting failed transactions..."
   - "Calculating gas wasted..."
   - "Finding your worst trades..."
   - "Preparing the roast..."
   - "This might hurt a little..."
   - "Generating brutal honesty..."

Implementation:
- Use useState for current message
- Use useEffect with setInterval to rotate messages
- Clean up interval on unmount
- Display message with fade-in animation
- Include loading spinner (use daisyUI loading component)

Style:
- Center everything vertically and horizontally
- Use large text for messages
- Add some personality with emojis or fire icons
- Smooth transitions between messages
- Dark theme compatible

Add TypeScript types.
Keep it simple but entertaining.
Include JSDoc comment.
